---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/content';
---
<Layout title="Donor support"><PageIntro eyebrow="Help with your giving" title="Your generosity deserves clear support." description="Find help with receipts, recurring donations, and payments made through the foundation’s donation services." /><section class="section container prose"><h2 id="receipts">Receipts and donation history</h2><p>Use the confirmation email sent by the service that processed your donation. This redesigned website does not hold your payment records or migrate donor account passwords from WordPress.</p><p>If you cannot find a receipt, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Donation%20receipt%20request`}>{site.email}</a> with the approximate donation date, amount, and the email address you used. Do not send card numbers or bank credentials.</p><h2 id="recurring">Managing a recurring gift</h2><p>Follow the management link or instructions in your original provider’s receipt to change or cancel a recurring gift. Moving the website does not move or cancel an existing subscription.</p><p>For older PayPal/GiveWP gifts, use the original processor’s records or ask the foundation to help locate the payment. For Give Lively gifts, start with its confirmation email and official support instructions.</p><h2 id="payment-status">Did my payment succeed?</h2><p>Only your payment provider’s confirmation establishes whether a donation succeeded. This page does not confirm a payment. If a payment appears pending or failed, check your provider’s receipt/status before trying again to avoid a duplicate gift.</p><h2>Need a hand?</h2><p><a href="/contact/?topic=Giving">Contact the foundation about your donation</a> or <a href="/donate/">explore giving options</a>.</p></section></Layout>
